Z||000003||WKDFIRO||03-24-2001||06:22 AM||||Blue wasn't an option except for and only 87. So an 85 GT couldn't come in Blue from the factory. You could get the factory paint code but not from the factory in 85. And Ive never heard of a factory blue 87 SE...would be nice. What kind of wheels did it have?<P>Wooly mammoth stuff seats? Tan on blue doesn't sound very appealing...<P>I think that someone once said that the VIN number could also indicate what the original color was...I might be wrong....||||reg||1
